# Orbital Plunge: excess damage is damage beyond lethal, with damage already marked taken into account (the ruling). Bot2's
# Phyrexian Soulgorger is an 8/8. The first Plunge's 6 damage is below lethal: no excess, so no Lander token. The second Plunge needs
# only 2 more to be lethal, so its 6 has excess and a Lander token is created while the Soulgorger dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Orbital Plunge
Orbital Plunge
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Phyrexian Soulgorger
Island x21

